            "description": "",
            "summary": "Logitech International reported its best quarterly earnings since the pandemic on Tuesday, as the computer peripherals maker was boosted by \u200bhigher sales of video conferencing equipment and educational spending.  The U.S.-Swiss maker of \u200ccomputer mice and keyboards said its sales rose 6% year-over-year to $1.42 billion for the three months ended \u200cDecember 31.  Its adjusted operating income jumped 17% to $312 million, beating the consensus estimate of $287 million.",
